# Path to the worldbuilding content tree. Defaults to `./` (this
# repo's root) if unset, so the layout below works out of the box:
#
#   <repo>/
#     content/
#     content_meta/
#     assets/             (optional)
#
# Override only if you keep content somewhere else.
# BUNNYTRAIL_WORLD_DIR=/absolute/path/to/world
